  "Set up a market of older experts and buyers, run it week by week, and see who gets help and who gets paid.": "Bumuo ng merkado ng nakatatandang eksperto at mamimili, patakbuhin linggo-linggo, at tingnan kung sino ang natutulungan at nababayaran.",
